Dear <%= @event.user.username %>,

We are pleased to inform you that your event titled "<%= @event.title %>" has been successfully submitted on the SciLifeLab Training Portal.

Event Details:
- Event Title: <%= @event.title %>
- URL: <%= event_url(@event) %>
- Start Date: <%= @event.start.strftime('%d %B %Y') %>
- End Date: <%= @event.end.strftime('%d %B %Y') %>

You can view and manage your event using the following link:
<%= event_url(@event) %>

<% unless @event.user.has_role?('trusted_user') %>
  Next steps for your event:
  - Your event has been submitted for review by our administrators.
  - If approved, the event will be published and visible to the public on the SciLifeLab Training Portal.
  - If the event requires any changes, you will receive an email with the suggested improvements.
  - If the event is declined, you will receive an email with the reason for the decision, and the event will be removed from the portal.
<% end %>

We appreciate your contribution and look forward to seeing your event on our platform.

Thank you for being a part of our community!

Best regards,
The SciLifeLab Training Portal Team